      "text": "Over the past months, a single Wikipedia editor has been quietly shaping @AbdulElSayed's entry. \n\nThe editing has been intensive and highly directed. For example: \n\n+ Hasan Piker controversy got cut down. \n+ Syed's antisemitism problem – deleted.\n+ Harris and Obama endorsements went in. \n+  A line saying AIPAC’s brand is “toxic” included.\n\nIs it an op? \n\nWell, two weeks ago the same editor had this to say in an edit summary on the El-Sayed page:\n\n“another half month of this shit.”\n\n🧵",
