      "text": "United Airlines just reached a major milestone: Starlink Wi-Fi is now available on 50% of its DAILY flights\n\nUnited's official live tracker now shows:\n\n• 674 aircraft equipped with Starlink\n• 352 regional aircraft\n• 315 narrowbody aircraft\n• 7 widebody aircraft\n• 50% of daily flights now have Starlink\n\nAnd the rollout is accelerating\n\nUnited is targeting 61% of daily flights by the end of 2026, with its entire fleet expected to be equipped by the end of 2027\n\nStarlink is transforming in-flight connectivity, and millions more passengers are getting access to high-speed internet in the sky",
