      "text": "Grok @Bot can research which doctors are the best in your area, call them by phone and make an appointment!",
      "quote": {
        "author": "minchoi",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1638359113221517312/CBZaJFyA_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-11-03 23:02:40",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-11-03T15:02:40.000Z",
        "id": "2117633564736938471",
        "images": [
          "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWNYeRmXQAA8HBX.jpg?name=small"
        ],
        "media": [
          {
            "height": 1526,
            "type": "photo",
            "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWNYeRmXQAA8HBX.jpg?name=small",
            "width": 1080
          }
        ],
        "name": "Min Choi",
        "text": "Grok Bot just made a doctor's appointment for me while I was driving...\n\nMy daughter hurt her foot landing a jump at dance practice.\n\nI told Grok Bot what happened, how she was feeling, and what I saw: not much swelling, iced, and her pain seemed manageable.\n\nIt gave me a few nearby options, including a pediatric orthopedist with X-rays on site, and offered to call when they opened.\n\nGrok Bot called and got her in at 9:30 the same day.\n\nThe whole call was transcribed live, and when the receptionist asked for more info, it asked me in real time.\n\nIt also got the insurance, payment options and pricing, had the intake forms sent to my email, and put it on my calendar.\n\nThe receptionist knew the call was recorded, and I could review the recording afterward.\n\nAll while I was driving.\n\nGrok Bot is going to completely change people's lives.",
        "url": "https://x.com/minchoi/status/2117633564736938471",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
      "retweet": null,
